                <formatted-text>
                  <run>Shows zone stats, calculates the number of active orders, and the avg Surge %. Data relative only to OD and successful orders.

- Placed orders are bucketed based on order_placed_at.
- Delivered orders are bucketed based on order_report_time.
- Active orders are bucketed based on both order_placed_at and order_report_time.
- Mean delay and couriers count are based on created_at_bucket.
- Surge % and DPS mean delay are based on dps_session_timestamp (if unavailable, dps_session_id_created_at or order_placed_at - 8 minutes)</run>
                </formatted-text>
